<biblStruct xml:id="b0">
	<monogr>
		<title level="m" type="main">PDFormer, and ModWaveMLP over other models stems from their ability to model spatio-temporal heterogeneity. However, our model surpasses these by harnessing the power of Time-Aware Spatial Identity Embedding, which adeptly captures the intricate dynamics of spatial heterogeneity, further refining the spatio-temporal representation and yielding even better results</title>
		<author>
			<persName><surname>Staeformer</surname></persName>
		</author>
		<imprint/>
	</monogr>
</biblStruct>

<biblStruct xml:id="b1">
	<monogr>
		<title level="m" type="main">While STPGNN demonstrates commendable performance on certain datasets by prioritizing crucial nodes in the spatial dimension, our model surpasses it by incorporating the Time-Aware TopK Attention module. This innovative feature further refines the modeling of important nodes</title>
		<imprint/>
	</monogr>
	<note>extending its focus to the temporal dimension</note>
</biblStruct>

